    "summary": "For a **CHAOS LORD** model other than a **TERMINATOR** or **JUMP PACK** model. In the Declare Battle Formations step, the bearer may start in Reserves rather than on the battlefield.\n\nIf it does, in a single Movement phase of your choosing, you may pick 1 model from a **LEGIONARIES** or **CHOSEN** unit of yours that:\n\n- is on the battlefield\n- still has at least 2 models\n- is not an Attached unit\n\nThe picked model is destroyed, and rules triggered by a model's destruction do not apply. The bearer is then:\n\n- placed where that model fell, or as near to that spot as it can be\n- allowed to end within Engagement Range of an enemy unit only if the removed model had been within Engagement Range of that unit\n- the Leader of that unit, attached to it",
